BLOODFEUD!

AS ARMENIAN SOLDIERS ARE FORCED TO DEFEND AGAINST AZERBAIJANI 
AGGRESSION, RUSSIAN FORCES HAVE BEEN CALLED UPON TO INTERVENE. 

THE 33RD TANK GUARDS HAS BEEN AIRLIFTED FROM THE FIELD AT 
IRAN TO ARMENIA. YOUR OVERALL MISSION IS TO AID THE ARMENIAN 
COUNTER-THRUST AGAINST AZERBAIJAN.

AMERICAN FORCES HAVE ALSO ARRIVED IN-COUNTRY ON THE SIDE OF THE 
AZERBAIJANI AND UNDER THE BANNER OF A MULTILATERAL FORCE.

1ST TROOP HAS BEEN ISSUED IT'S FIRST MISSION. YOUR ORDERS 
ARE TO PROCEED UPON A COURSE HEADING OF 147ø SOUTH BY SOUTH EAST. 
YOUR FIRST TARGETS ARE DUG IN MLF FORWARD OP'S PLATFORMS. 

THE SECOND DESIGNATED TARGET ZONE IS ON A COURSE HEADING OF 162ø
SOUTH. YOU ARE TO NEUTRALIZE ALL ENEMY FIELD REFUELING MODULES AS
WELL AS ANY MBTS OR CFVS STANDING WATCH.
